    <h1>A Business Analyst who Design Engineers</h1>
    <p>Reliable, innovative, and dynamic individual with experience in business analytics, AI assisted development, data analytics and user experience. Skilled in Python, AWS, and modern development tools, with a focus on DevOps concepts and leading teams. Quick to learn new technologies and committed to consistent professional growth.</p>
    <p>Currently working as a Business Analyst, supporting stakeholder needs through requirement analysis, process optimization, and data-driven insights while continuing to build technical depth.</p>

    <h2 class="hs">What I do</h2>
    <div class="g2">
      <div class="c"><h3>Requirements and discovery</h3><p>Turning stakeholder conversations, specifications and edge cases into scenarios the whole team agrees on before anything is built.</p></div>
      <div class="c"><h3>Product ownership</h3><p>Scoping phases, managing change requests and deciding what each release needs, from the first sprint to phase 2.</p></div>
      <div class="c"><h3>Delivery governance</h3><p>Running Jira, workflows and quality tracking so status is visible to the client and to the team.</p></div>
      <div class="c"><h3>Design engineering</h3><p>Wireframing, prototyping and building small apps myself, so conversations with designers and developers stay concrete.</p></div>
    </div>

